 Start
 Create a container for the interface
 Display title “Group Generator”
 Create a text area for entering names
 Create an input box for group size
 Create a button labeled “Generate”
 Create an output area inside the container
When the button is clicked:
Read names from the text area
 Split names by line into a list
 Remove empty entries from the list
Read group size
If number of names = 0 then
  Output “Please enter some names”
  Stop
 End if
If group size ≤ 0 then
  Output “Invalid group size”
  Stop
 End if
Shuffle the list of names
Set groups = empty list
 Set i = 0
While i < number of names do
  Create a group from names i to i + group size
  Add group to groups list
  Increase i by group size
 End while
Set group number = 1
For each group in groups do
  Output “Group” and group number
  Output all names in the group
  Increase group number by 1
 End for
Display all groups inside the output area (inside the container)
End


